[{"id":"1664085625899827200","date":1685583905000,"rawContent":"a strawberry tragedy. poor earth. #ClimateEmergency","media":null,"username":"DetroitJean","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":true,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":1.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":16,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":4,"sumOfClimate":7,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":1.0},{"id":"1666154007591518248","date":1686077045000,"rawContent":"So, do you believe the Kochs or your own lungs yet about #ClimateEmergency? You see the water lapping up on Lakeshore Drive, the sky is fire hazy, it hasn't rained in a looooong time. But ok, its a hoax.     Dummies.","media":null,"username":"DetroitJean","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":true,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":16,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":4,"sumOfClimate":8,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":2.0},{"id":"1666154560610500608","date":1686077177000,"rawContent":"Canada on fire was not on my #ClimateEmergency  bingo card. But here we are, fossil fueling ourselves to extinction in a thousand different ways. We are one earth, sharing one sky, air, and water. There is no other way to think, never was.","media":null,"username":"DetroitJean","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":true,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":16,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":4,"sumOfClimate":9,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":3.0},{"id":"1666155115344953367","date":1686077309000,"rawContent":"When the selaginella's relatives trees were giant, fell down and eventually became the gas we put in our cars - what about this did we think would end well? Who do we think we are burning the carbon of long ago? #ClimateEmergency","media":null,"username":"DetroitJean","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":true,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":16,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":4,"sumOfClimate":10,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":4.0},{"id":"1666156538384220170","date":1686077649000,"rawContent":"People like to believe all these fires etc. are raptury and not #ClimateEmergency cuz a climate emergency is something we did and can try to control by changing our actions and firmly controlling the 1%. Rapture is for the weak minded who pretend there is nothing they can do.","media":null,"username":"DetroitJean","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":true,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":16,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":4,"sumOfClimate":11,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":5.0},{"id":"1667987772546613249","date":1686514249000,"rawContent":"The #quebecwildfires  started June 1st. The slow response of the US was awful. This is my #detroit lungs speaking. @POTUS  Do better with the #climatecrisis","media":null,"username":"DetroitJean","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":true,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":16,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":4,"sumOfClimate":12,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":6.0}]